We're particularly interested in postgraduate talent with backgrounds in: ​

• Computer Science, Maths , Physics, Engineering, Statistics and related STEM disciplines ​

• Machine learning, Artificial Intelligence, data science, software or systems&nbsp; engineering ​

• Research, modelling or computational work ​

• Strong coding ability ​

• Industrial placements, fellowships or substantial technical projects ​

You don't need to have followed a traditional consulting path. We care about technical depth, curiosity, judgement and your potential to grow. ​

